Lake pins the NP-completeness foundation to that commit and takes the CPAP model
from the sibling cpap-np-hardness package at ../cpap-np-hardness. The optional
generated Challenge.lean specification reproduces its definitions of the
cycle-path assignment problem and edge load verbatim, adding a documentation
comment where that library has none as its docs/FOUNDATION.md prescribes.
Challenge.lean is omitted from the distribution and default build; the delivered
proofs are in Approximation/ and imported by Solution.lean.
